                      %mi R
                    %mo +
                  %mo ,
                  %mo{:lspace => "verythinmathspace", :rspace => "0em"} +
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} (\mathbf{R}^+,+)
            to an arbitrary closed monoidal category, we have the concept of
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Cauchy-complete+category"} Cauchy-complete category
          %h3#regular_sequences_and_nets Regular sequences and nets
          %p
            One can also consider sequences and nets with a
